# penv project environment
# copy this file to the project root as ".env" and edit
#
# syntax:
#   KEY=VALUE      set an environment variable
#   PATH+=DIR      prepend DIR to PATH
#
# rules:
#   1. comments must start with # at column 1
#   2. values are literal: no quotes, no variable expansion
#   3. PATH+= may be relative to this .env directory
#   4. .venv in this directory is added to PATH automatically

# JAVA_HOME=C:\Program Files\Java\jdk-17
# PATH+=.\tools\bin
# PROJECT_ROOT=C:\code\demo
